  "projection_description": "Each run_complete.json retains all per-method numerical evaluation records, model timing and selection records, generation metadata, common-reference identifiers, data fingerprints and DGP details. Hostnames, job identifiers, device allocation numbers, attempt identifiers and timestamps are removed. Top-level files_sha256 records for absent raw arrays/checkpoints are omitted; original member hashes remain above.",
  "cv_timing_availability": "Original run records contain the per-method sum of 15 cross-validation worker elapsed times. The compact source archive does not contain the individual worker metadata files. This package preserves each recorded per-run sum; reproduce_tables.py recomputes its mean and sample SD across replications.",
